WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.450 --> 00:00:02.519
RRI rests on four dimensions.

2
00:00:02.799 --> 00:00:06.991
Let's look at what each one asks of
researchers, and why they only work when they

3
00:00:06.991 --> 00:00:07.663
are combined.

4
00:00:08.863 --> 00:00:13.919
Anticipation means considering the possible
impacts, risks and futures of your work.

5
00:00:14.199 --> 00:00:18.814
It includes foresight, scenario building,
and what is sometimes called ethical

6
00:00:18.814 --> 00:00:23.074
imagination: asking what if, while
there is still time to change course.

7
00:00:24.274 --> 00:00:29.619
Inclusion means involving a diverse range
of stakeholders, including the public, in

8
00:00:29.619 --> 00:00:31.229
shaping research agendas.

9
00:00:31.509 --> 00:00:35.989
It makes sure that many perspectives are
heard, especially those that are often left

10
00:00:35.989 --> 00:00:36.202
out.

11
00:00:37.402 --> 00:00:42.629
Reflexivity asks researchers to examine
their own values, assumptions and context.

12
00:00:42.909 --> 00:00:47.725
It promotes critical thinking and ethical
self-awareness, for individuals and for

13
00:00:47.725 --> 00:00:48.498
institutions.

14
00:00:49.698 --> 00:00:54.857
Responsiveness means being open and ready
to change direction in response to new

15
00:00:54.857 --> 00:00:58.146
knowledge, stakeholder
input, or shifts in society.

16
00:00:58.426 --> 00:01:01.455
It moves us from rigid
planning to dynamic learning.

17
00:01:02.655 --> 00:01:05.663
These are not separate steps
to tick off one after another.

18
00:01:05.943 --> 00:01:10.274
They are interconnected processes that
run through the whole life of a project.

19
00:01:11.474 --> 00:01:14.994
Anticipation without inclusion
leads to biased foresight.

20
00:01:15.274 --> 00:01:18.517
We only imagine the futures
that people like us can see.

21
00:01:19.717 --> 00:01:23.215
And reflexivity without
responsiveness leads to inaction.

22
00:01:23.495 --> 00:01:25.863
We may notice a problem,
but change nothing.

23
00:01:27.063 --> 00:01:29.175
Each dimension depends on the others.

24
00:01:29.455 --> 00:01:33.615
Together, they support the responsible
governance of research and innovation.

25
00:01:34.815 --> 00:01:37.525
Some funders turn this
into a practical framework.

26
00:01:37.805 --> 00:01:43.625
The UK's Engineering and Physical Sciences
Research Council uses AREA: anticipate,

27
00:01:43.625 --> 00:01:45.399
reflect, engage, and act.

28
00:01:45.679 --> 00:01:49.306
The labels differ, but the substance
matches the four dimensions.

29
00:01:50.506 --> 00:01:51.850
Thank you for watching.

30
00:01:52.130 --> 00:01:55.650
Continue with the module to
put these ideas into practice.
